/E (Audio plugin developer and mechatronic engineer with a passion for creating tools that enhance creative workflows. Specializing in JUCE framework development and digital signal processing. My hands-on hardware expertise includes designing guitar pedal effects and building synthesizer circuits with integrated circuits and programmable platforms like Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Arduino, Teensy 4.1, and Daisy Seed. Currently designing a multi-effects pedalboard. Guitarist and music lover.)
